            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a99f203c6818-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The majority held that the prosecution\u2019s violation of *Napue* required reversal of the judgment and a new trial."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a99f203c6818a16ec5f5c72763acf2806ba455bebef7dcaa81832f982cddcae1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a99f203c6818-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court concluded that the failure to correct Sneed\u2019s false testimony violated the Due Process Clause, entitling Glossip to a new trial."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a99f203c6818a16ec5f5c72763acf2806ba455bebef7dcaa81832f982cddcae1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a99f203c6818-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 34,
              "start": 34
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The judgment of the Oklahoma Court of Criminal Appeals was reversed and the case is remanded for further proceedings consistent with this opinion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a99f203c6818a16ec5f5c72763acf2806ba455bebef7dcaa81832f982cddcae1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a99f203c6818-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas filed a dissent, stating his disagreement with the majority\u2019s analysis."
      }
